# Auto WP > Create Wp Circle and Create Spline Circle (PLAN.md 13.4, D11).
#
# createWpCircleToolStripMenuItem_Click asks four questions - Radius 50, Points 20, Direction 1,
# Angle 0 - reads them only once all are answered, and adds a WAYPOINT (16) per point from the
# start angle round to it again inclusive, at Default Alt (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:2963-3048):
# twenty points make twenty-one rows. createSplineCircleToolStripMenuItem_Click asks five, adds a
# DO_SET_ROI (201) at the click, then laps of five SPLINE_WAYPOINTs (82), the first lap at the
# minimum altitude and each point after it a quarter of the step higher, while a lap starts at or
# under the maximum (:2857-2961): 5 to 20 by 5 is five laps, the last point at 24. The positions
# are held to the C# under mono by crates/mp-mission's circle tests.

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen plan
window 1600x1200
budget 15
# A first budget, set by hand until a passing run records one.

expect mission.items 0

# An answer int.TryParse refuses is said once all four are in: "Bad Radius", nothing added.
# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.50x0.50:right
click menu-autoWP
click menu-createWpCircle
expect plan.prompt Radius
key ctrl+u
type wide
key Return
settle 0.3
key Return
settle 0.3
key Return
settle 0.3
key Return
expect plan.prompt message
expect plan.prompt.text Bad Radius
key Return
expect mission.items 0

# Escape at any question adds nothing.
click map@0.50x0.50:right
click menu-autoWP
click menu-createWpCircle
key Return
expect plan.prompt Points
expect plan.prompt.text Number of points to generate Circle
key Escape
expect plan.prompt none
expect mission.items 0

# The four as offered: twenty-one waypoints at Default Alt's 100.
click map@0.50x0.50:right
click menu-autoWP
click menu-createWpCircle
expect plan.prompt Radius
expect plan.prompt.value 50
key Return
expect plan.prompt.value 20
key Return
expect plan.prompt.text Direction of circle (-1 or 1)
expect plan.prompt.value 1
key Return
expect plan.prompt angle
expect plan.prompt.value 0
key Return
expect plan.prompt none
expect mission.items 21
expect mission.last.command 16
expect mission.last.alt 100
expect mission.last.position true

# The spline circle, as offered: the ROI and five laps of five.
click map@0.50x0.50:right
click menu-autoWP
click menu-createSplineCircle
expect plan.prompt Radius
key Return
expect plan.prompt min alt
key Return
expect plan.prompt max alt
key Return
expect plan.prompt alt step
key Return
expect plan.prompt angle
key Return
expect plan.prompt none
expect mission.items 47
expect mission.commands ~ 16,201,82,82
expect mission.last.command 82
expect mission.last.alt 24
